}
```

The loop iterates over the `$days` array and populates the `$regitem` array with its values. If `$days` is influenced by user input or external data, an attacker could manipulate this input to inject malicious objects or data into the application, leading to unintended behavior or security breaches.

The modification replaces this potentially vulnerable code with:

```php
foreach ($events as $event) {
